			<Property name="English" value="For the safety of its inhabitants, the Space Anomaly's existence must remain secret. However, Nada and Polo often find themselves unable to ignore external situations where lives are endangered.&#xA;&#xA;A distress signal within range of the Anomaly has been traced. Travellers are asked to visit its last known coordinates, and anonymously aid any survivors." />
